  ('p-001','aurum-wireless-earbuds-pro','Aurum Wireless Earbuds Pro with Active Noise Cancellation','Aurum Audio','Experience studio-grade audio in the palm of your hand with the Aurum Wireless Earbuds Pro. Featuring industry-leading active noise cancellation, these earbuds block out the world so you can focus on what matters—your music, your calls, your moment.

With up to 32 hours of total playback, IPX5 water resistance, and Bluetooth 5.3 multipoint pairing, the Aurum Pro earbuds are built for your daily grind. The ergonomic design ensures all-day comfort, while the Qi-compatible charging case keeps you powered on the go.',ARRAY['Active Noise Cancellation with transparency mode','Up to 32 hours total battery with charging case','IPX5 sweat and water resistance','Custom 12mm titanium drivers for rich bass','Multipoint Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity','Wireless Qi charging case']::text[],'{"Driver Size":"12mm Titanium","Battery Life":"8h earbuds, 32h with case","Bluetooth":"5.3","Water Resistance":"IPX5","Charging":"USB-C + Qi Wireless","Weight":"5.2g per earbud"}'::jsonb,14999,19999,42,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/10885667/pexels-photo-10885667.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/9784242/pexels-photo-9784242.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/25772336/pexels-photo-25772336.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/16387546/pexels-photo-16387546.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.7,2847,ARRAY['bestseller','new-arrival','noise-cancelling']::text[],true,'cat-audio'),
  ('p-002','aurum-studio-headphones','Aurum Studio Over-Ear Headphones - Hi-Res Audio','Aurum Audio','The Aurum Studio Over-Ear Headphones deliver reference-quality sound with stunning clarity across the full frequency range. The 40mm beryllium drivers reproduce every nuance of your favorite tracks with breathtaking precision.

Designed for marathon listening sessions, the plush memory foam ear cushions and adjustable headband provide exceptional comfort. With 40 hours of battery life and hybrid noise cancellation, you will never want to take them off.',ARRAY['Hi-Res Audio certified with 40mm beryllium drivers','Hybrid active noise cancellation','40-hour battery life on a single charge','Plush memory foam ear cushions','Foldable design with premium carry case']::text[],'{"Driver Size":"40mm Beryllium","Battery Life":"40 hours","Noise Cancellation":"Hybrid ANC","Connectivity":"Bluetooth 5.2 + 3.5mm","Weight":"258g"}'::jsonb,24999,29999,18,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/16387546/pexels-photo-16387546.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4249193/pexels-photo-4249193.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/9784240/pexels-photo-9784240.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.8,1532,ARRAY['bestseller','hi-res-audio']::text[],true,'cat-audio'),
  ('p-003','aurum-bluetooth-speaker-xl','Aurum XL Portable Bluetooth Speaker - 360 Sound','Aurum Audio','Take the party anywhere with the Aurum XL Portable Bluetooth Speaker. Its 360-degree driver array fills any space with rich, room-shaking sound while the rugged IP67 exterior shrugs off water, dust, and drops.

With 24 hours of playback and a built-in power bank to charge your devices, the Aurum XL is the ultimate adventure companion. Pair two speakers for true stereo sound.',ARRAY['360-degree omnidirectional sound','IP67 waterproof and dustproof','24-hour battery life','Party pairing for stereo sound','Built-in USB power bank function']::text[],'{"Output":"40W","Battery Life":"24 hours","Water Resistance":"IP67","Connectivity":"Bluetooth 5.1","Weight":"680g"}'::jsonb,8999,NULL,3,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/9784242/pexels-photo-9784242.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/18386862/pexels-photo-18386862.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/16888144/pexels-photo-16888144.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.5,967,ARRAY['low-stock']::text[],true,'cat-audio'),
  ('p-004','tiger-smartwatch-gold-edition','Tiger Smartwatch Gold Edition - Health & Fitness Tracker','Tiger Wear','The Tiger Smartwatch Gold Edition combines luxury design with serious health tracking. The stunning 1.4-inch AMOLED display stays visible even in bright sunlight, while the gold stainless steel case makes a statement on any wrist.

Track over 80 sport modes, monitor your heart rate, blood oxygen, and even take an ECG. With 7-day battery life and 5 ATM water resistance, this is the only wearable you need.',ARRAY['1.4-inch AMOLED display with always-on mode','Heart rate, SpO2, and ECG monitoring','Built-in GPS with 80+ sport modes','7-day battery life','5 ATM water resistance','Gold stainless steel case']::text[],'{"Display":"1.4\" AMOLED","Battery Life":"7 days","Water Resistance":"5 ATM","Sensors":"Heart Rate, SpO2, ECG, Accelerometer","Material":"316L Stainless Steel","Weight":"52g"}'::jsonb,19999,25999,55,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/5208869/pexels-photo-5208869.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/11450271/pexels-photo-11450271.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/16888144/pexels-photo-16888144.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/14541068/pexels-photo-14541068.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.6,3214,ARRAY['bestseller','new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-wearables'),
  ('p-005','tiger-fitness-band-lite','Tiger Fitness Band Lite - Activity & Sleep Tracker','Tiger Wear','The Tiger Fitness Band Lite is your entry into smart health tracking. Monitor your steps, sleep quality, and daily activity with a comfortable, lightweight band that you will forget you are wearing.

With 14 days of battery life on a single charge, you can focus on your goals instead of your charger. Available in multiple colors to match your style.',ARRAY['0.96-inch OLED display','Sleep and stress tracking','20 sport modes','14-day battery life','Lightweight silicone band']::text[],'{"Display":"0.96\" OLED","Battery Life":"14 days","Water Resistance":"3 ATM","Sport Modes":"20","Weight":"22g"}'::jsonb,4999,7999,0,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/5208781/pexels-photo-5208781.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/14541068/pexels-photo-14541068.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/5208869/pexels-photo-5208869.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.3,5421,ARRAY['out-of-stock']::text[],true,'cat-wearables'),
  ('p-006','aurum-ultrabook-14-pro','Aurum Ultrabook 14 Pro - Intel Core i7, 16GB RAM','Aurum Computing','The Aurum Ultrabook 14 Pro is a powerhouse in a feather-light frame. The stunning 2.8K OLED display delivers vibrant colors and deep blacks, perfect for creative work and entertainment alike.

Powered by an Intel Core i7 processor with 16GB of RAM and a 1TB NVMe SSD, this ultrabook handles everything from 4K video editing to intense multitasking with ease. The all-aluminum chassis weighs just 1.2kg.',ARRAY['Intel Core i7-13700H processor','14-inch 2.8K OLED display, 90Hz','16GB LPDDR5 RAM, 1TB NVMe SSD','Intel Iris Xe graphics','All-aluminum chassis, 1.2kg','Thunderbolt 4, Wi-Fi 6E']::text[],'{"CPU":"Intel Core i7-13700H","GPU":"Intel Iris Xe","RAM":"16GB LPDDR5","Storage":"1TB NVMe SSD","Display":"14\" 2.8K OLED 90Hz","Weight":"1.2kg","Ports":"2x Thunderbolt 4, USB-A, HDMI"}'::jsonb,129999,149999,12,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/25772336/pexels-photo-25772336.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/11450271/pexels-photo-11450271.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4249193/pexels-photo-4249193.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/16888144/pexels-photo-16888144.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.9,843,ARRAY['bestseller','premium']::text[],true,'cat-computing'),
  ('p-007','aurum-mechanical-keyboard-rgb','Aurum Mechanical Keyboard RGB - Hot-Swappable Switches','Aurum Computing','Type with precision and style on the Aurum Mechanical Keyboard. Featuring hot-swappable switches, you can customize your typing feel without soldering. The gasket-mounted aluminum frame provides a premium, cushioned typing experience.

With per-key RGB, PBT keycaps, and dual connectivity, this keyboard is as functional as it is beautiful.',ARRAY['Hot-swappable mechanical switches','Per-key RGB backlighting','Aluminum frame with gasket mount','USB-C and Bluetooth connectivity','PBT keycaps with double-shot legends']::text[],'{"Layout":"75% (84 keys)","Switches":"Hot-swappable, pre-installed linear","Connectivity":"USB-C, Bluetooth 5.1","Material":"Aluminum + PBT keycaps","Weight":"1.1kg"}'::jsonb,11999,NULL,27,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/25772336/pexels-photo-25772336.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/9784240/pexels-photo-9784240.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.7,1245,ARRAY['new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-computing'),
  ('p-008','mens-premium-cotton-tshirt','Men''s Premium Cotton Crew Neck T-Shirt - 3 Pack','Tiger Apparel','Elevate your everyday wardrobe with the Tiger Apparel Premium Cotton T-Shirt 3-Pack. Made from 200 GSM combed cotton, these tees are substantial, soft, and built to last through countless washes.

The pre-shrunk fabric and tagless design ensure all-day comfort, while the classic crew neck pairs effortlessly with any outfit. Stock up on essentials that never go out of style.',ARRAY['100% premium combed cotton, 200 GSM','Pre-shrunk for perfect fit','Ribbed crew neckline','Tagless comfort design','Available in 6 colors']::text[],'{"Material":"100% Combed Cotton","Weight":"200 GSM","Fit":"Regular","Care":"Machine wash cold","Pack Size":"3 shirts"}'::jsonb,3999,5999,120,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/9594692/pexels-photo-9594692.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8387807/pexels-photo-8387807.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/14534753/pexels-photo-14534753.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.4,4210,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-mens-fashion'),
  ('p-009','mens-slim-fit-jeans-dark-wash','Men''s Slim Fit Stretch Jeans - Dark Wash','Tiger Apparel','Find your perfect fit with the Tiger Apparel Slim Fit Stretch Jeans. The 2% elastane blend provides all-day comfort and mobility, while the slim silhouette keeps you looking sharp.

The dark indigo wash transitions seamlessly from casual to smart-casual occasions. Reinforced stitching at stress points ensures these jeans will be in rotation for years.',ARRAY['98% cotton, 2% elastane for stretch comfort','Slim fit through thigh and leg','5-pocket styling','Reinforced stress points','Dark indigo wash with subtle fading']::text[],'{"Material":"98% Cotton, 2% Elastane","Fit":"Slim","Rise":"Mid-rise","Wash":"Dark Indigo","Care":"Machine wash inside out"}'::jsonb,6999,8999,34,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/1488470/pexels-photo-1488470.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/14833749/pexels-photo-14833749.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/2601442/pexels-photo-2601442.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.5,2187,ARRAY['bestseller']::text[],true,'cat-mens-fashion'),
  ('p-010','womens-silk-blouse-ivory','Women''s Silk Blend Blouse - Ivory','Tiger Couture','Effortless elegance starts with the Tiger Couture Silk Blend Blouse. The silk-cotton fabric drapes beautifully while remaining easy to care for. The relaxed fit and covered button placket create a clean, sophisticated silhouette.

Pair it with tailored trousers for the office or jeans for a weekend brunch. The versatile ivory tone complements any wardrobe.',ARRAY['Silk-cotton blend for luxurious drape','Relaxed fit with covered button placket','French seam construction','Hand-washable silk blend','Versatile ivory color']::text[],'{"Material":"70% Silk, 30% Cotton","Fit":"Relaxed","Care":"Hand wash cold","Closure":"Covered buttons"}'::jsonb,7999,10999,5,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/9558711/pexels-photo-9558711.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8619007/pexels-photo-8619007.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8386651/pexels-photo-8386651.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.6,893,ARRAY['low-stock','deal']::text[],true,'cat-womens-fashion'),
  ('p-011','womens-leather-crossbody-bag','Women''s Genuine Leather Crossbody Bag - Tan','Tiger Couture','Crafted from full-grain leather that only gets better with age, the Tiger Couture Crossbody Bag is an investment in timeless style. The compact design holds your essentials without the bulk.

The RFID-blocking pocket protects your cards, while the solid brass hardware adds a touch of luxury. Each bag develops a unique patina over time, making it truly yours.',ARRAY['Full-grain genuine leather','Adjustable crossbody strap','RFID-blocking interior pocket','Solid brass hardware','Lifetime craftsmanship guarantee']::text[],'{"Material":"Full-grain Leather","Size":"10\" x 7\" x 3\"","Strap Drop":"Adjustable 18-26\"","Hardware":"Solid Brass","Lining":"Cotton twill"}'::jsonb,11999,NULL,22,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/8386663/pexels-photo-8386663.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/32549955/pexels-photo-32549955.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/16891088/pexels-photo-16891088.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.8,567,ARRAY['premium','new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-womens-fashion'),
  ('p-012','tiger-pro-blender-1500w','Tiger Pro Blender 1500W - Professional Grade','Tiger Home','The Tiger Pro Blender crushes ice, pulverizes vegetables, and blends smoothies to silky perfection with its powerful 1500W motor and 6-prong stainless steel blade. The variable speed dial gives you complete control over texture.

The 2-liter Tritan pitcher is shatterproof and BPA-free. Cleanup is easy—just pop the parts in the dishwasher. Backed by a 5-year motor warranty.',ARRAY['1500W motor with variable speed dial','6-prong stainless steel blade','2-liter BPA-free Tritan pitcher','Pulse function for precise control','Dishwasher-safe parts','5-year motor warranty']::text[],'{"Power":"1500W","Pitcher Capacity":"2 liters","Blade":"6-prong stainless steel","Speeds":"Variable + pulse","Material":"BPA-free Tritan"}'::jsonb,9999,13999,45,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/4713243/pexels-photo-4713243.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/12689256/pexels-photo-12689256.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/19599329/pexels-photo-19599329.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/7166645/pexels-photo-7166645.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.7,1876,ARRAY['bestseller','deal']::text[],true,'cat-kitchen-appliances'),
  ('p-013','tiger-espresso-machine-pro','Tiger Espresso Machine Pro - 15 Bar','Tiger Home','Bring the cafe home with the Tiger Espresso Machine Pro. The 15-bar Italian pump extracts rich, crema-topped shots, while the built-in conical burr grinder grinds fresh for every cup.

The stainless steel steam wand froths milk to silky microfoam for cappuccinos and lattes. With programmable shot volumes and a removable water reservoir, barista-quality espresso has never been easier.',ARRAY['15-bar Italian pump pressure','Built-in conical burr grinder','Stainless steel steam wand','Programmable single and double shots','Removable 2L water reservoir']::text[],'{"Pressure":"15 bar","Grinder":"Conical burr, 30 settings","Water Tank":"2 liters","Material":"Stainless steel","Power":"1450W"}'::jsonb,34999,44999,8,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/19563199/pexels-photo-19563199.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/25852330/pexels-photo-25852330.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/4740585/pexels-photo-4740585.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.8,645,ARRAY['low-stock','premium']::text[],true,'cat-kitchen-appliances'),
  ('p-014','tiger-air-fryer-digital-6qt','Tiger Digital Air Fryer 6QT - Touch Screen','Tiger Home','Cook healthier meals with the Tiger Digital Air Fryer. Using rapid air circulation technology, it delivers crispy, golden results with little to no oil. The 6-quart basket is perfect for family-sized portions.

Eight preset functions take the guesswork out of cooking fries, chicken, steak, and more. The digital touch screen makes it easy to adjust time and temperature on the fly.',ARRAY['6-quart capacity, feeds 4-6 people','8 preset cooking functions','Digital touch screen with temperature control','Rapid air technology, little to no oil','Dishwasher-safe non-stick basket']::text[],'{"Capacity":"6 quarts","Temperature Range":"180-400F","Presets":"8","Display":"Digital touch screen","Power":"1700W"}'::jsonb,8999,NULL,60,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/19599329/pexels-photo-19599329.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/12689256/pexels-photo-12689256.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/15409513/pexels-photo-15409513.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.6,3204,ARRAY['bestseller']::text[],true,'cat-kitchen-appliances'),
  ('p-015','tiger-ceramic-vase-set-gold','Tiger Ceramic Vase Set of 3 - Gold Accents','Tiger Decor','Add a touch of luxury to your space with the Tiger Ceramic Vase Set. Each piece is handcrafted with gold foil accents over a matte black finish, creating a striking contrast that catches the eye.

The set of three graduated sizes allows for versatile styling—group them together or scatter throughout your home. The waterproof interior means they are ready for fresh flowers.',ARRAY['Set of 3 graduated sizes','Handcrafted ceramic with gold foil accents','Matte black finish','Waterproof interior for fresh flowers','Decorative use indoor or outdoor']::text[],'{"Material":"Ceramic","Sizes":"8\", 10\", 12\" tall","Finish":"Matte black + gold foil","Indoor":"Yes","Outdoor":"Covered outdoor only"}'::jsonb,5999,8999,28,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/12128381/pexels-photo-12128381.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/38796245/pexels-photo-38796245.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/17134085/pexels-photo-17134085.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.5,432,ARRAY['deal','new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-home-decor'),
  ('p-016','tiger-hyaluronic-serum-gold','Tiger Hyaluronic Acid Serum with Gold Infusion','Tiger Beauty','Plump, hydrate, and illuminate your skin with the Tiger Hyaluronic Acid Serum. The multi-weight hyaluronic acid complex penetrates multiple layers of the skin for deep, lasting hydration, while 24K gold leaf adds a subtle radiance.

This lightweight serum absorbs in seconds and layers perfectly under moisturizer and makeup. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.',ARRAY['2% hyaluronic acid complex','24K gold leaf infusion','Lightweight, fast-absorbing formula','Suitable for all skin types','Vegan and cruelty-free','30ml glass dropper bottle']::text[],'{"Key Ingredient":"2% Hyaluronic Acid + 24K Gold","Size":"30ml","Skin Type":"All types","Vegan":"Yes","Cruelty-Free":"Yes"}'::jsonb,3499,4999,80,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/36339062/pexels-photo-36339062.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/36698525/pexels-photo-36698525.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/20171275/pexels-photo-20171275.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/24602070/pexels-photo-24602070.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ']::text[],4.7,5621,ARRAY['bestseller','new-arrival']::text[],true,'cat-skincare'),
  ('p-017','tiger-vitamin-c-brightening-cream','Tiger Vitamin C Brightening Night Cream','Tiger Beauty','Wake up to brighter, more radiant skin with the Tiger Vitamin C Brightening Night Cream. The stable ethyl ascorbic acid form of Vitamin C works overnight to fade dark spots and even out skin tone.

Combined with niacinamide and hyaluronic acid, this non-greasy cream nourishes and plumps while you sleep. Suitable for all skin types.',ARRAY['10% Vitamin C (ethyl ascorbic acid)','Niacinamide and hyaluronic acid blend','Brightens and evens skin tone','Non-greasy night formula','50ml jar']::text[],'{"Key Ingredient":"10% Vitamin C","Size":"50ml","Use":"Night","Skin Type":"All types"}'::jsonb,2999,NULL,15,ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/24602070/pexels-photo-24602070.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/36698525/pexels-photo-36698525.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600','https://images.pexels.com/photos/8128670/pexels-photo-8128670.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=600&w=600']::text[],ARRAY['']::text[],4.5,2340,ARRAY['deal']::text[],true,'cat-skincare')
